2. What is the CMU mascot?, that might help select a RX option

### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget https://challenge-files.cylabacademy.net/library/d825fde6581b1311eafdd403da1cc96f1f98fe3fe84cd71d850310ebb3908088/message.wav
2. file message.wav
3. git clone https://github.com/colaclanth/sstv.git 
4. cd sstv
5. sudo python setup.py install
6. sstv -d ~/message.wav -o message.png
7. xdg-open message.png
```

